---
description: Dialogs close without clearing their content or selected item
alwaysApply: true
---

# Dialog close behavior

Control every dialog with a boolean `open` state. Closing must only set that boolean to `false`.

Do not set the selected item, form draft, or other dialog content to `null` or empty when the dialog closes. Keep that data so the content stays visible through the close animation.

Reset or replace content when opening a dialog for a new item, or after a successful submit — not on close.
